        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During the fiscal year ended June 30, 2025, we continued our diversification strategies by developing new silicon and packaging platforms to expand our SAM and offer higher performance products.",
